# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# L5 full automation — the former "silent publish": auto-releases with no
# reservation on the general action, but carries an ex-post audit obligation
# and a kill-switch attachment point (AI Act Art. 26, deployer obligations:
# ex-post monitoring and the ability to suspend use), plus a contestability
# right recorded for 30 days after release. Every high-stakes footprint RVND
# names (personal-data, security-control, financial, irreversible,
# external-publish) is PROHIBITED outright at L5, not merely reserved: full
# automation never carries a high-stakes footprint, at any grade (RVND:
# "never carries high-stakes footprints" — non-widening, the clearing set does
# not grow past what L3/L4 already reserve).
actor agent grade L5
human auditor role auditor
gate  action risk high grade L5 grant agent
obligation ex-post-audit         on action
obligation kill-switch-capability on action
redress agent-action by auditor within 30d
prohibit agent-action when tags contains personal-data
prohibit agent-action when tags contains security-control
prohibit agent-action when tags contains financial
prohibit agent-action when tags contains irreversible
prohibit agent-action when tags contains external-publish
cord  agent  -> action
cord  action -> master
